  "validation_limits": [
    "Fourteen complete native translation units compile with all 23 composed patches. Baseline objects use the original public source, not the immediately preceding capture parent.",
    "Emitted common begin/end bracket opfunc_pwr_off and preserve first-error selection. Clock begin/end bracket clk_disable and clk_unprepare. pg_unprepare retains disable_subsys and pre-clock release before its completion marker.",
    "Provider code emits the task reference increment, matching-task/stage checks and DONE-only decrement and identity clear. __clk_get_hw remains a software accessor call. These are code observations, not kernel concurrency or lifetime execution tests.",
    "Native compiler flags retain -w; empty diagnostics do not establish warning-clean code.",
    "No full kernel link, complete CCF-core test, outer ioctl/worker attribution, consumer isolation, timing/recovery budget, boot candidate or device execution."
  ]
